begincodeV2
color:180,225,255
name:矩形形按钮_带底色_指定格式
params:UIButton 按钮,Vector3 按钮尺寸,String 标题,Float 字体比例
lines:
Color 线框颜色_常态=fun create.color(Color 79,215,228,255)
Color 底板颜色_常态=fun create.color(Color 0,40,70,170)
Color 线框颜色_按下=fun create.color(Color 255,222,0,255)
Color 底板颜色_按下=fun create.color(Color 255,255,255,130)
//@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3
varf UIButton.按钮.setColor(Color 0,0,0,0)
varf UIButton.按钮.text(String )
varf UIButton.按钮.size(var 按钮尺寸)
//@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3
UIRect 底板=fun ui.rect(Vector3 0.3,0.5,0:var 按钮尺寸:Float 0:Float 0:var 底板颜色_常态)
varf UIButton.按钮.addSon(var 底板)
varf UIRect.底板.pos(Vector3 0.5,0.5,0)
//@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3
UIRect 边框=fun ui.rect(Vector3 0.3,0.5,0:var 按钮尺寸:Float 0:Float 2:var 线框颜色_常态)
varf UIButton.按钮.addSon(var 边框)
varf UIRect.边框.pos(Vector3 0.5,0.5,0)
//@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3
Float 按钮高=varf Vector3.按钮尺寸.y()
Float 字号=fun float.multiply(var 按钮高:var 字体比例)
UILabel 文本框=fun ui.text(Vector3 0,0,0:var 字号:var 线框颜色_常态:var 标题:Enum 1)
varf UIButton.按钮.addSon(var 文本框)
varf UILabel.文本框.pos(Vector3 0.5,0.5,0)
//@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3
List 参数列表=fun create.list()
varf List.参数列表.add1(var 底板:var 底板颜色_按下)
varf List.参数列表.add1(var 边框:var 线框颜色_按下)
varf List.参数列表.add1(var 文本框:var 线框颜色_按下)
//@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3
varf UIButton.按钮.addPointDownCB(String 样式_按钮按下_变色:var 参数列表)
//@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3
varf UIButton.按钮.addClickCB(String 声效_按钮效果_点击声效:List )
//@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3
List 参数列表=fun create.list()
varf List.参数列表.add1(var 底板:var 底板颜色_常态)
varf List.参数列表.add1(var 边框:var 线框颜色_常态)
varf List.参数列表.add1(var 文本框:var 线框颜色_常态)
//@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3
varf UIButton.按钮.addPointUpCB(String 样式_按钮松开_变色:var 参数列表)
//@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3@3
